 at a young age, so she spent a lot of time in the hospital."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c32884"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/94/94d781e6016115ee21b74e7d0f23300a66a0b643cf24b87be198c5a737b64af2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b9/b90fcd27dd86bf584dcec2ab9d909fa14ba213b0a11b35e61317cc2c8c9582b3.webp","width":107,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c32886","characterName":"クロア・エデン","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c32886"},"originalCharacterName":"クロア・エデン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The first princess of the Kingdom of Eden and Riche's elder sister. She is also a Saint of the Church of Mother Eve."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is betrothed to Felton, the prince of Central Empire."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c32886"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/56/563e1aa8c87de881d7b619a4779f4f2f18599d252bae67644fbb3361b9bc2545.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ad/adb8e1a407bfb0071816afbaeb8b3c2c9330dc3ed57b36af87cae676b443685f.webp","width":256,"height":218,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c32887","characterName":"アーサー","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c32887"},"originalCharacterName":"アーサー","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Current